Gamma FX2 core delivery, bounded native profile. Build: make
Compress: ./comp9 INPUT (creates archive9). Decode: ./archive9 (creates enwik9).
Both refuse output replacement. No external assets or command options at decoding.
This preserves the tested native -c/-d frontend, not the upstream full-enwik9 reorder/split pipeline.
Includes unmodified trimmed native code, selected packed weights, dictionary and Gamma envelope.
Native source: native/LICENSE and original headers; Gamma envelope: GAMMA-LICENSE.
Additional original attribution texts retained under notices/.
Model permission and CUDA-derived math licensing remain unresolved; no submission eligibility claim.
Native binary requires Linux x86-64-v3 and standard ELF runtime libraries.
FNV-1a64 is an internal corruption check, not cryptographic authentication.
